# .bobignore — DEFENSE-IN-DEPTH only. NOT the isolation wall.
# It is workspace-global (not per-mode), @-mentions bypass it, and
# insert_content/search_and_replace can bypass it on save.
# The real wall = custom-mode fileRegex + the PreToolUse hook (exit-2).
#
# Here we still hide src/ from the read tool + listings as a first layer for the
# roles that must never see code (witness, isolate, compliance-officer, incident-commander).

# Build artifacts / deps
node_modules/
dist/
build/

# Sensitive config
.env
.env.*

# Secrets / local state fixtures we don't want read broadly
fixtures/secrets/
*.key
*.pem

# Scratch suggests it is not project source
.bob/scratch/*

# Large / temp
*.tmp
*.log
.cache/

# NOTE: we deliberately do NOT ignore src/ globally, because surgeon and
# control-agent MUST read it. Per-role hiding is the hook's job, not .bobignore's.